[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3845764290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115804#issuecomment-3845764290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115804","id":3845764290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lObTC","user":{"login":"ej-sanmartin","id":29460583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDYwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29460583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin","html_url":"https://github.com/ej-sanmartin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T07:16:13Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T07:24:32Z","body":"@raulsntos hey, thanks for the feedback! I actually initially tried adding these changes to `register_types.cpp` first but was hitting timing issues.\r\n\r\nDirect calls at `MODULE_INITIALIZATION_LEVEL_EDITOR` in `initialize_mono_module()` crashes because `EditorSettings` isn't instantiated yet.\r\nAnd then after I tried adding this to `EditorNode::add_init_callback()` which only fires when *opening* a project, not in Project Manager. Didn't crash but none of these enum options were rendering in the settings modal at that point.\r\n\r\nThe Project Manager creates `EditorSettings` but not `EditorNode`, so I ended up in `_load_defaults()` which runs during `EditorSettings::create()`.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**tldr:** attempted making changes to `register_types.cpp`, when that didn't work went further along the init processes until these enums were finally rendering properly again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3845764290/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3851119362","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115804#issuecomment-3851119362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115804","id":3851119362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7li2sC","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T05:07:17Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T05:07:17Z","body":"Ah, I see. In that case, I think it's reasonable. Thanks for checking.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.co