:"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T20:27:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T20:27:52Z","body":"@neikeq i'll work on that. To clarify, you mean wrap all the enum initialization into this method?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3961854378/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963101559","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115804#issuecomment-3963101559","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115804","id":3963101559,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sOCF3","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-26T00:29:08Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T00:29:08Z","body":"I just realized this PR does more than just change the definition location of those settings. The code is not wrapped in `#ifdef MODULES_MONO_ENABLED`, and the entries are now part of `EditorSettings.xml`, so this PR is more similar to #71728. If that's the case, then hooking into the init callback is not the solution because that would only happen when the module is enabled.\r\n\r\nSo this may be fine after all.\r\nHowever, there's duplication between `editor_settings.cpp` and `GodotSharpEditor.cs` and I don't know if defining the same setting twice might cause issues. Any reason why the code in `GodotSharpEditor.cs` wasn't removed?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ff9dbaa1671edff1089de0b743ab82cacadba752/modules/mono/editor/GodotTools/GodotTools/GodotSharpEditor.cs#L549-L624\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ff9dbaa1671edff1089de0b743ab82cacadba752/modules/mono/editor/GodotTools/GodotTools/GodotSharpEditor.cs#L30-L36\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963101559/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963587200","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115804#issuecomment-3963587200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115804","id":3963587200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sP4qA","user":{"login":"ej-sanmartin","id":29460583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDYwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29460583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin","html_url":"https://github.com/ej-sanmartin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-26T02:29:12Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T02:29:12Z","body":"It was decided that [this PR will purposely duplicate these values](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113994#issuecomment-3714332809).\r\n\r\nThe main issue was that the `.cs` file is not loaded during the Project Selection screen, thus causing the original bug reported in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113994. We cannot load it at the Project Selection without embedding the C# runtime at that point, which is a heavy cost.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963587200/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963661494","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115804#issuecomment-3963661494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115804","id":3963661494,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sQKy2","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-26T02:57:58Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T02:57:58Z","body":"> It was decided that [this PR will purposely duplicate these values](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113994#issuecomment-3714332809).\r\n\r\nBut if this PR now defines them in `EditorSettings::_load_defaults`, what's the point of keeping it duplicated in C#? It's an additional place to keep in sync, and for you to add the comments `// Keep in sync with editor/settings/editor_settings.cpp` makes me think you forgot to either remove the duplicated code from `GodotSharpEditor.cs` or to include that file in the comment.\r\n\r\nI also want to confirm, if we keep the duplicated code, whether it's safe to redefine an editor setting twice. When running in the editor (not the project manager), this PR defines the same setting first in `EditorSettings::_load_defaults` and later in `GodotSharpEditor._EnablePlugin`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963661494/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5877399934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115804#issuecomment-5877399934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115804","id":5877399934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXlIBfg","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T19:56:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T19:56:24Z","body":"> I also want to confirm, if we keep the duplicated code, whether it's safe to redefine an editor setting twice.\r\n\r\nI didn't encounter any errors when testing this PR, and the code looks like it just overrides the setting that was previously defined, so it's probably fine.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/25f7c4d1a70d8e76ad65b2573c0d48210d670c38/editor/settings/editor_settings.cpp#L406-L408\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/25f7c4d1a70d8e76ad65b2573c0d48210d670c38/editor/settings/editor_settings.cpp#L264-L269\r\n\r\nBut I agree we should, at the very least, add a `// Keep in sync with editor/settings/editor_settings.cpp` comment to `GodotSharpEditor.cs`.\r\n\r\n@ej-sanmartin Are you still interested in working on this PR?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5877399934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]